# Methods compiled for the first render of a Qt canvas (GLMakie screens of
# type Screen{QMLMakie.QMLWindow}) and the window's pages, which the
# precompile workload cannot run without a GL context. Generated with
# `julia --trace-compile=out.jl` around hammerhead() startup (planar and
# stereo) and test/qt_window.jl + test/qt_stereo_window.jl, merged with the
# previous file (a trace omits what is already precompiled), keeping lines
# that mention QML/Makie/ComputePipeline/GeometryBasics/CxxWrap/Observables/
# Hammerhead/ShaderAbstractions/ModernGL/FreeType, without anonymous
# functions or script (Main) types, and dropping lines whose `precompile`
# no longer succeeds. Stale lines are skipped at load; regenerate after
# GLMakie/QMLMakie upgrades if window startup slows down.
